      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some historical patterns exist, viewing ethnic diversity as an automatic predictor of civil unrest is an oversimplification. Many highly diversified, stable nations manage this dynamic effectively through strong institutional frameworks and inclusive governance. Instead of an automatic \"stability discount,\" your model should account for the *quality* of governance and the project's demonstrable commitment to equitable benefit distribution across all ethnic groups.",
